WEBVTT

00:05.690 --> 00:08.720
<i>I really am...</i>

00:10.230 --> 00:12.060
<i>in love.</i>

00:13.990 --> 00:18.880
<i>I always thought love would never
 happen for me. Is this okay...?</i>

00:19.570 --> 00:22.440
<i>Stop. You decided you'd give this your all.</i>

00:23.260 --> 00:27.400
<i>I need to go tell Hananoi-kun I like him!</i>

01:59.300 --> 02:05.600
<b>Episode 6</b>

01:59.300 --> 02:05.600
<b>Our First Valentine's</b>

02:02.700 --> 02:05.640
Oh, Hotaru-chan. Good morning.

02:06.120 --> 02:08.400
Good morning, Hananoi-kun!

02:11.780 --> 02:14.490
Hananoi-kun, listen. I really...

02:15.400 --> 02:18.390
Hananoi-kun, I, um...

02:18.390 --> 02:20.160
L...

02:20.160 --> 02:22.650
L-Liii...

02:23.120 --> 02:25.280
N-Never mind! It's nothing!

02:25.640 --> 02:27.410
<i>Wait, what?</i>

02:27.660 --> 02:28.750
I li...

02:29.700 --> 02:30.850
Li...

02:32.130 --> 02:34.130
L-Liii...!

02:34.550 --> 02:38.310
<i>Is it always this hard to tell
 someone you like them?!</i>

02:39.630 --> 02:41.800
Okay, let's start the evening staff meeting.

02:40.440 --> 02:42.440
<i>What should I do?</i>

02:42.750 --> 02:46.360
First off, we have a new 
part-timer joining us today.

02:46.360 --> 02:47.220
Yao-kun?

02:47.220 --> 02:52.110
Hello! My name is Yao Sohei. 
It's really great to meet you all.

02:52.110 --> 02:52.890
Huh?

02:55.960 --> 02:57.120
Oh?

02:57.120 --> 02:59.830
Wow! Hotako?

03:00.510 --> 03:01.520
Yao-kun?

03:02.640 --> 03:04.860
I haven't seen you since graduation!

03:05.350 --> 03:06.810
Is he a friend of yours?

03:06.810 --> 03:10.170
Um, we were in the same class
 in elementary school.

03:11.930 --> 03:14.610
Save the emotional reunion for later, okay?

03:14.610 --> 03:15.920
Let's get back to the meeting.

03:16.400 --> 03:17.300
All right.

03:18.240 --> 03:21.900
You know Sohei-kun, right?

03:23.000 --> 03:24.800
I think I like him.

03:25.910 --> 03:28.840
Oh, Yao-kun? No kidding!

03:30.100 --> 03:33.660
I know I'm not good enough for him.

03:33.660 --> 03:37.880
That isn't true! You have a lot 
of great qualities, Non-chan!

03:39.430 --> 03:43.380
Hey, Hotaru-chan... Will you help me out?!

03:45.630 --> 03:46.960
Sure!

03:50.190 --> 03:51.710
Hotako!

03:52.220 --> 03:53.370
Good work today.

03:53.370 --> 03:55.030
You too.

03:55.800 --> 03:58.010
But would you knock the "Hotako" thing off?

03:58.010 --> 04:02.080
Oh, come on! I can't call you "Hotaru"
like my little queen at home.

04:00.340 --> 04:02.840
<b>The Yao Family's
Beloved Dog, Hotaru (Female)</b>

04:03.460 --> 04:06.080
But man, what a surprise!

04:06.080 --> 04:09.710
What's it been, four years?
Never thought I'd run into you here.

04:10.620 --> 04:11.600
Yeah.

04:12.110 --> 04:15.310
Though, you know,
 I'm glad you're doing well.

04:15.980 --> 04:21.230
I mean, at graduation, you seemed...
I don't know. Kinda out of sorts.

04:21.570 --> 04:26.260
You cut your hair all of a sudden 
and then wouldn't talk to anybody.

04:28.340 --> 04:30.450
W-Well, I've gotta run!

04:30.450 --> 04:33.750
Hey, wait up. Hotako!

04:34.240 --> 04:36.070
Oh, excuse me.

04:40.580 --> 04:41.870
Hananoi-kun!

04:42.520 --> 04:44.140
Hananoi?

04:45.300 --> 04:48.470
Chasing a girl down... You some pervert?

04:49.190 --> 04:51.790
N-No, it's not like that. He's actually...

04:51.790 --> 04:54.230
Wait, is this guy your boyfriend?

04:54.230 --> 04:58.510
Sorry, man! Hotako and I went 
to elementary school together.

04:58.510 --> 05:01.730
I was so happy to see her again,
I just wanted to chat for a bit.

05:02.990 --> 05:04.260
"Hotako"?

05:05.310 --> 05:07.930
All right, well, see you at work!

05:10.640 --> 05:16.070
Um, that was Yao-kun. 
He started working at my store today.

05:17.590 --> 05:19.490
What a coincidence.

05:19.790 --> 05:22.560
Yeah, it was a big surprise.

05:24.630 --> 05:25.510
<i>What is this...?</i>

05:25.950 --> 05:27.600
Sh-Shall we get going?

05:27.600 --> 05:28.330
Yeah.

05:41.810 --> 05:44.850
Was your boyfriend good after that?

05:44.850 --> 05:45.540
Huh?

05:45.540 --> 05:49.030
He didn't get, like, super jealous or angry?

05:49.030 --> 05:52.240
Oh, no, he seemed perfectly normal.

05:52.240 --> 05:56.180
I never imagined you'd be 
into someone like that, Hotako.

05:56.180 --> 06:00.150
You got yourself such a good-looking
boyfriend, I couldn't help worrying a little.

06:00.500 --> 06:03.260
Why? He's a really nice guy.

06:03.260 --> 06:05.670
Yeah? I guess it's all good, then.

06:10.290 --> 06:11.680
Hotaru-chan.

06:12.400 --> 06:13.670
<i>Actually...</i>

06:14.070 --> 06:19.930
<i>Hananoi-kun's "let's always be together"
 vibe </i>has<i> gotten stronger recently.</i>

06:17.340 --> 06:18.980
I hope work went okay.

06:22.290 --> 06:23.350
Let's go.

06:23.350 --> 06:24.660
Yeah, sure.

06:28.770 --> 06:33.190
You've been picking me up from work
 every day lately. Did something happen?

06:35.090 --> 06:38.210
I'm a bit worried about that guy from before.

06:38.210 --> 06:39.050
Huh?

06:39.760 --> 06:41.540
Oh, Yao-kun?

06:41.540 --> 06:44.210
Is everything okay?
Has he tried anything funny?

06:44.500 --> 06:47.210
Everything's fine. He's a good guy.

06:49.150 --> 06:50.710
A good guy, huh?

06:51.110 --> 06:54.120
I bet he's popular with the ladies, though.

06:54.120 --> 07:00.230
Yeah, definitely. All the girls liked 
him in elementary school

07:00.590 --> 07:03.810
because he was so nice 
and got along with everyone.

07:04.430 --> 07:06.560
All of my friends included.

07:09.040 --> 07:10.310
What about you?

07:10.920 --> 07:11.740
Huh?

07:14.060 --> 07:15.030
Oh.

07:15.460 --> 07:20.170
Nothing like that! I didn't see 
Yao-kun that way at all! Honest!

07:21.320 --> 07:23.830
Yeah? I'm glad.

07:23.830 --> 07:26.330
<i>He said that with a smile on his face...</i>

07:27.160 --> 07:32.510
<i>But afterward, Hananoi-kun started coming 
to see me at work more and more often.</i>

07:34.090 --> 07:41.240
U-Um, d-don't you think you've been 
dropping by a little too much, maybe?

07:43.970 --> 07:48.090
You know, you're right. 
Sorry for bothering you at work.

07:52.800 --> 07:55.210
Hotako, you sure don't hold back!

07:55.520 --> 07:57.640
I get how he feels, though!

07:57.640 --> 08:00.860
Just dying to spend every second
with the person you like!

08:00.860 --> 08:02.480
<i>That's not it.</i>

08:02.480 --> 08:07.130
<i>Before, it did just feel like he wanted 
to be with me. But now...</i>

08:07.510 --> 08:12.390
Why do people in love have so much 
trouble controlling themselves?

08:12.390 --> 08:16.150
<i>Come to think of it,
it was the same thing back then...</i>

08:17.380 --> 08:19.880
So, um, listen...

08:20.220 --> 08:24.810
I heard a rumor that you like Sohei-kun, 
Hotaru-chan. Is that true?

08:24.810 --> 08:28.810
Huh? That's a rumor? It's totally wrong.

08:29.230 --> 08:32.320
O-Of course it is! I'm glad.

08:33.090 --> 08:37.830
<i>I didn't think too hard about what
she was going through then</i>

08:38.390 --> 08:41.410
<i>and wound up leaving a sliver of doubt.</i>

08:41.960 --> 08:45.830
<i>I shouldn't have just let it go
when she forced a smile like that.</i>

08:46.590 --> 08:48.330
Hotaru-chan.

08:48.330 --> 08:49.480
You're a liar.

08:55.030 --> 08:57.840
<i>It's been a long time since 
I dreamt about the past.</i>

08:58.430 --> 09:00.940
<i>Oh... I get it now.</i>

09:00.940 --> 09:04.840
<i>I think I understand why I couldn't 
tell Hananoi-kun I like him.</i>

09:05.250 --> 09:08.350
<i>I might still be too scared.</i>

09:09.400 --> 09:14.680
<i>Because I know how strong feelings 
can sometimes change people.</i>

09:20.390 --> 09:21.700
Hotaru-chan.

09:22.790 --> 09:24.700
Care to take a little detour?

09:26.220 --> 09:28.170
Here, let's share it.

09:28.170 --> 09:29.130
Thank you.

09:29.700 --> 09:31.000
What a treat!

09:33.240 --> 09:35.490
It's so hot and fresh.

09:35.490 --> 09:38.300
Hotaru-chan, you got cream on your cheek.

09:39.430 --> 09:40.730
How embarrassing!

09:41.890 --> 09:44.460
<i>Things are getting back to normal again.</i>

09:45.350 --> 09:49.480
For some reason, I feel so 
relaxed when we're together.

09:50.340 --> 09:52.640
I was just thinking the same thing!

09:54.600 --> 09:59.900
Um, listen... I know you've been
a little down recently.

10:01.040 --> 10:04.030
It's my fault, isn't it?
I'm sorry about that.

10:04.030 --> 10:07.980
I know I can be... kind of intense.

10:08.520 --> 10:10.840
I'm well aware of that, but...

10:11.850 --> 10:13.620
But it's okay now!

10:14.180 --> 10:16.170
I'll try not to make you 
uncomfortable any—

10:16.170 --> 10:19.970
Why? Why are you only ever worried about me?

10:20.290 --> 10:24.340
Things <i>aren't</i> okay! You're the one
 feeling down, Hananoi-kun.

10:24.670 --> 10:27.020
If something is bothering you,
 won't you tell me?

10:28.060 --> 10:32.010
Don't hide behind a fake smile 
until it's too late.

10:32.010 --> 10:34.610
I want you to tell me how you really feel!

10:37.490 --> 10:39.370
It isn't your fault, Hotaru-chan.

10:40.160 --> 10:44.320
And I know it's not like anything
 has happened yet.

10:44.730 --> 10:50.830
It's just... I don't know. I can't get 
the thought out of my head.

10:51.610 --> 10:55.590
One day, if you ever meet someone 
else who isn't like me...

10:55.590 --> 11:01.390
A better person. Someone who's
 a better match for you.

11:01.720 --> 11:04.080
I think about what would happen then...

11:05.040 --> 11:09.040
In the end, everyone chooses
 someone else over me.

11:10.510 --> 11:13.880
Hananoi-kun, c-come with me for a minute!

11:15.280 --> 11:18.020
Hotaru-chan? What are you—

11:21.750 --> 11:23.580
R-Recharging!

11:23.580 --> 11:25.520
Listen, over Christmas,

11:25.520 --> 11:30.570
I realized if I was going to fall in love, 
I wanted it to be with you, Hananoi-kun.

11:30.920 --> 11:35.590
You and only you.
That's how you made me feel!

11:35.590 --> 11:40.710
So you don't even need
to worry about anyone else!

11:48.120 --> 11:50.860
Hotaru-chan, I like you so much.

11:52.030 --> 11:55.360
I like you more than anyone, Hotaru-chan.

11:56.340 --> 11:59.260
More than anyone else in the world.
 I like you so much.

12:05.350 --> 12:10.790
<i>In that moment, it took all the 
strength I had to hold on to him,</i>

12:11.790 --> 12:14.960
<i>and I wasn't able to say, "I like you too."</i>

12:15.660 --> 12:17.880
<i>I didn't think it would him happy</i>

12:17.880 --> 12:21.880
<i>if I just blurted out that I also liked 
him more than anyone in the world.</i>

12:23.180 --> 12:25.380
<i>Man, love sure is hard.</i>

12:26.260 --> 12:27.820
<i>I need to become stronger.</i>

12:29.190 --> 12:34.200
<i>Going forward, I want to be able to take care
of the person I care about so much.</i>

12:38.370 --> 12:42.830
<i>Since then, everything has seemed 
back to normal on the surface,</i>

12:42.830 --> 12:47.190
<i>but I'm sure he's still 
worried about Yao-kun.</i>

12:48.640 --> 12:51.390
<i>And I still haven't said it.</i>

12:52.900 --> 12:56.420
<i>But I </i>do<i> like him! I've got to make a move!</i>

12:55.500 --> 12:56.550
Hotaru-chan.

12:57.110 --> 12:58.350
Hotaru-chan?

12:58.840 --> 13:00.360
S-Sorry!

13:00.360 --> 13:03.250
It's okay. Should we start heading home?

13:03.690 --> 13:07.430
<i>That said, I don't know exactly what to do.</i>

13:09.680 --> 13:11.680
Valentine's Fair

13:09.680 --> 13:11.680
Exceptional Dessert Recipes

13:09.680 --> 13:11.680
<b>Sweets for a Special Day</b>

13:09.680 --> 13:11.680
<b>Make Chocolates the Easy Way</b>

13:09.680 --> 13:11.680
Chocolate that Won't Make You Gain Weight

13:09.680 --> 13:11.680
<b>Say how you feel with homemade chocolate</b>

13:14.490 --> 13:17.060
<i>Th-That's it!</i>

13:15.060 --> 13:17.060
<b>Sweets for a Special Day</b>

13:15.060 --> 13:17.060
<b>Make Chocolates the Easy Way</b>

13:15.060 --> 13:17.060
Chocolate that Won't Make You Gain Weight

13:15.060 --> 13:17.060
<b>Say how you feel with homemade chocolate</b>

13:17.060 --> 13:20.600
H-Hananoi-kun, are you free on the 14th?

13:21.240 --> 13:22.700
Erm, yeah.

13:23.100 --> 13:26.390
Then, hey, let's go on a date that day!

13:26.910 --> 13:28.910
<b>Make Chocolates the Easy Way</b>

13:26.910 --> 13:28.910
From simple chocolates to macarons!

13:26.910 --> 13:28.910
A huge collection of recipes!

13:29.280 --> 13:31.410
<i>Valentine's Day, huh?</i>

13:31.850 --> 13:34.790
<i>It's the perfect opportunity
 to tell him I like him.</i>

13:34.790 --> 13:39.050
Hota-chan, are you making chocolates 
for someone? That's great!

13:39.050 --> 13:43.930
But there are so many different kinds 
that I'm not sure what to make.

13:43.930 --> 13:48.750
In that case, there's a Valentine's fair 
going on in the event space upstairs.

13:48.750 --> 13:50.220
Wanna go together?

13:50.510 --> 13:52.420
Would you like to try one?

13:51.880 --> 13:53.260
Wow!

13:53.260 --> 13:56.530
<i>I didn't expect Yao-kun to tag along!</i>

14:01.270 --> 14:05.020
Hey, these are pretty impressive, right?

14:05.020 --> 14:07.950
Do people actually gift stuff 
like this on Valentine's?

14:07.950 --> 14:10.930
Well, you gotta go big if you want 
the chocolate to send a message!

14:10.930 --> 14:12.860
<i>Oh, right! Chocolates!</i>

14:13.170 --> 14:15.880
But I bet you're so popular, Yao-kun,

14:15.880 --> 14:19.650
that you end up buried 
in chocolate every year.

14:19.650 --> 14:21.880
Nah, not really.

14:22.630 --> 14:25.350
Even though the girls used
to line up to give you chocolates?

14:25.350 --> 14:27.280
When did that ever happen?

14:27.280 --> 14:31.200
That was why I couldn't give 
you my self-introduction card.

14:31.200 --> 14:32.500
What are you talking about?

14:32.890 --> 14:35.570
We had a special class before graduation

14:32.910 --> 14:39.020
Name

14:32.910 --> 14:39.020
Birthday

14:32.910 --> 14:39.020
Star Sign/Blood Type

14:32.910 --> 14:39.020
Dreams

14:32.910 --> 14:39.020
Someone I Like

14:32.910 --> 14:39.020
Something I Like

14:35.570 --> 14:39.010
with an assignment where we were supposed
to exchange cards with three friends.

14:39.330 --> 14:43.490
But with the endless line after class, 
I gave up on giving him mine.

14:43.490 --> 14:46.140
What, really?
You should've just given it to me.

14:46.140 --> 14:50.200
I ended up giving cards to Non-chan, 
Chiho-chan, and Sasaki-kun...

14:50.200 --> 14:51.840
And that made three.

14:51.840 --> 14:53.730
Huh? Who's Sasaki?

14:53.730 --> 14:54.370
Huh?

14:54.370 --> 14:57.010
You two sure were good friends.

14:57.010 --> 14:58.840
Yeah, we really were!

14:57.010 --> 14:58.840
No, we weren't that close.

14:58.840 --> 14:59.450
Huh?

14:59.450 --> 15:00.160
Hmm?

15:07.420 --> 15:08.750
<i>Okay.</i>

15:09.790 --> 15:12.210
<i>I've never made my own chocolates before,</i>

15:12.880 --> 15:16.300
<i>and I bet Hananoi-kun wouldn't complain 
even if they turned out bad.</i>

15:17.740 --> 15:21.680
<i>So tomorrow I'll take the
 store-bought ones after all.</i>

15:24.910 --> 15:29.140
<i>I was so anxious about today, 
I got here a whole hour early.</i>

15:29.690 --> 15:32.750
<i>I really hope Hananoi-kun likes these.</i>

15:35.490 --> 15:44.610
I'm really sorry, but can we meet an hour later?

15:37.490 --> 15:39.970
<i>That's unusual. I wonder what happened.</i>

15:40.750 --> 15:44.630
Fine by me. Something up?

15:43.130 --> 15:44.630
It's not a big deal or anything

15:44.650 --> 15:45.980
Fine by me. Something up?

15:44.650 --> 15:45.980
It's not a big deal or anything

15:44.650 --> 15:45.980
Oh, wait

15:45.980 --> 15:47.980
It's not a big deal or anything

15:45.980 --> 15:47.980
Oh, wait

15:45.980 --> 15:48.260
It might take a little longer than that

15:50.330 --> 15:52.510
Er, hey, Hananoi-kun.

15:52.510 --> 15:57.200
<i>H-Hotaru-chan? Uh, did you already 
leave home? I'm sorry!</i>

15:57.200 --> 16:00.270
Oh, don't worry about that.

16:00.620 --> 16:01.900
Did something happen?

16:01.900 --> 16:07.420
<i>U-Um, actually, I ran into 
some trouble at home.</i>

16:07.920 --> 16:09.640
Should I come over?

16:09.640 --> 16:12.730
<i>What? Oh, no, it's totally fine—</i>

16:13.570 --> 16:15.120
H-Hananoi-kun?

16:15.120 --> 16:16.340
<i>Sorry.</i>

16:16.340 --> 16:18.790
<i>I promise I'll see you later today.</i>

16:18.790 --> 16:21.300
<i>Want to wait at home until then?</i>

16:21.300 --> 16:22.100
Huh?

16:22.100 --> 16:24.270
<i>I'll let you know once I have an idea of when.</i>

16:26.040 --> 16:28.550
Fine by me. Something up?

16:26.040 --> 16:28.550
It's not a big deal or anything

16:26.040 --> 16:28.550
Oh, wait

16:26.040 --> 16:28.550
It might take a little longer than that

16:26.040 --> 16:28.550
Voice Call

16:26.040 --> 16:28.550
<i>Is everything really okay?</i>

16:30.850 --> 16:33.100
<i>Would I be a problem if I just showed up?</i>

16:34.640 --> 16:37.510
<i>I at least want to give 
him the chocolates today.</i>

16:43.150 --> 16:44.630
<i>Hotaru-chan?!</i>

16:44.630 --> 16:47.130
I'm sorry. I was worried about you.

16:47.130 --> 16:50.690
<i>U-Uh, wow, okay then...</i>

16:50.690 --> 16:54.570
<i>Anyway, come in. It's kind 
of a mess right now, though.</i>

16:55.440 --> 16:56.980
<i>A mess?</i>

16:58.890 --> 17:00.060
Coming!

17:07.030 --> 17:12.560
H-Hananoi-kun! What happened to you?
 Um, you've got chocolate on you...

17:12.560 --> 17:16.140
Yeah, sorry. I just...

17:19.260 --> 17:24.450
I've been trying to bake since morning,
 but I keep messing it up.

17:24.990 --> 17:26.890
I'm sorry for spoiling our date!

17:27.300 --> 17:29.030
Th-That's okay!

17:29.590 --> 17:33.520
But what's this about?
Are you into baking, Hananoi-kun?

17:33.820 --> 17:36.830
N-No, it's my first time.

17:37.790 --> 17:41.650
I know I've been projecting my 
insecurities onto you recently.

17:42.020 --> 17:45.180
I can tell I haven't been making 
you happy, Hotaru-chan.

17:45.180 --> 17:49.910
So I thought, since it's Valentine's Day, 
I'd make you some chocolates.

17:50.530 --> 17:52.610
I thought if I made you something myself,

17:52.610 --> 17:55.560
and if it was good enough that you liked it,

17:56.260 --> 17:58.880
that it would make you happy again.

18:00.220 --> 18:02.720
<b>Make Chocolates the Easy Way</b>

18:04.180 --> 18:08.680
But it didn't work out at all.
 I'm such a dork.

18:08.680 --> 18:11.820
No, you aren't! 
And I know exactly how you feel!

18:12.930 --> 18:18.160
Hey, I'll help you clean up, 
so let's bake some together!

18:19.580 --> 18:23.040
I want to make some
chocolates for you too!

18:25.290 --> 18:27.290
Okay, here we go!

18:27.690 --> 18:30.910
I was trying to make a chocolate gateau.

18:30.910 --> 18:32.160
Mm-hm.

18:34.300 --> 18:40.040
Actually, I wanted to start 
practicing a week ago,

18:40.390 --> 18:44.750
but it took me so long to learn how 
to separate the yolks from the whites,

18:44.750 --> 18:47.680
I didn't have enough time to 
practice making the cake.

18:47.980 --> 18:52.570
<i>I'm just noticing, but Hananoi-kun 
must usually wear contacts.</i>

18:53.060 --> 18:56.040
<i>He's so stressed out 
and depressed over messing up,</i>

18:56.040 --> 18:59.080
<i>I feel like I'm seeing the totally 
natural Hananoi-kun today.</i>

19:00.800 --> 19:05.650
I'm impressed. You always seem like 
you can do everything with ease,

19:05.650 --> 19:09.300
but you actually work really hard 
to get new things right.

19:10.210 --> 19:14.250
That's one reason I like 
you so much, Hananoi-kun.

19:17.770 --> 19:22.280
<i>Huh? Did I just say, "I like you"?</i>

19:30.250 --> 19:33.690
This egg has two yolks in it.

19:38.880 --> 19:39.970
<i>I like you.</i>

19:41.020 --> 19:43.270
<i>I like you so much!</i>

19:44.410 --> 19:49.280
<i>I've never felt this way before. 
But I know it won't change.</i>

19:49.740 --> 19:53.830
<i>Even if I'm unsure of things, 
I know what I'm feeling right now</i>

19:54.300 --> 19:57.220
<i>is definitely the real thing!</i>

20:00.710 --> 20:02.590
It smells so good.

20:02.590 --> 20:03.360
Yeah.

20:06.650 --> 20:08.350
Listen, Hananoi-kun.

20:09.280 --> 20:12.160
When I was in elementary school,

20:12.430 --> 20:19.650
this weird rumor went around that I had a 
crush on a boy that my friend liked.

20:19.940 --> 20:23.390
It wasn't true, of course, and I denied it.

20:23.390 --> 20:28.650
But I didn't try very hard to explain things
to my friend, and it really hurt her.

20:29.770 --> 20:33.550
Is this the friend who cut your hair?

20:34.890 --> 20:35.730
Yup.

20:36.930 --> 20:39.690
We were so close, too.

20:39.690 --> 20:43.430
It made me realize that love
can change you, and that scared me.

20:43.840 --> 20:48.550
But I've always felt like if I'd understood 
what it meant to like someone,

20:48.550 --> 20:52.680
maybe things would have 
turned out differently.

20:53.180 --> 20:56.800
The reason I wanted to date you
 and learn what love means

20:56.800 --> 20:58.950
was partly because of that.

21:00.540 --> 21:05.290
You must have really cared
 for this friend, Hotaru-chan.

21:10.650 --> 21:11.550
Yeah.

21:15.170 --> 21:22.050
Hey, Hananoi-kun, doesn't the idea that 
you or I might change someday scare you?

21:24.710 --> 21:32.060
For me, before I started dating you, 
food was just sustenance in my eyes.

21:32.840 --> 21:37.010
You taught me how delicious it can be.

21:38.700 --> 21:42.520
If love has the power to change
 people for the worse,

21:42.980 --> 21:46.130
it must also have the power 
to change us for the better.

21:46.720 --> 21:49.050
That's what I realize when I watch you.

21:52.170 --> 21:53.040
Okay.

21:53.360 --> 21:54.670
Time to taste it.

21:59.920 --> 22:01.790
It's so good!

22:02.490 --> 22:06.430
Happy Valentine's Day, Hananoi-kun!

23:16.150 --> 23:19.200
S-Say, Hananoi-kun...

23:24.080 --> 23:28.730
Maybe you won't want this
since we baked our own.

23:30.040 --> 23:33.710
But I really like you, Hananoi-kun.

23:34.430 --> 23:37.830
I'm... in love with you!
